---
// "HOW I WORK" - two-column section below projects, inspired by reference photos
---

<section id="author" class="how-i-work">
  <div class="how-i-work__inner">
    <div class="how-i-work__photo">
      <div class="how-i-work__photo-placeholder">
        <span class="how-i-work__photo-label">Portrait</span>
      </div>
      <p class="how-i-work__caption">
        Driven by curiosity,&nbsp;expression,<br />utility.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="how-i-work__text">
      <p class="how-i-work__eyebrow" data-scramble="scroll">How I work</p>
      <p class="how-i-work__copy">
        At the heart of it, each project starts because it is interesting, beautiful, or useful. From there it gets researched, then expanded, refined, and built into something that functions.
      </p>
      <p class="how-i-work__copy">
        Development ranges from AI-directed - using agents to design, build, and iterate from concept to deployment - to hand-crafted, depending on what the project calls for.
      </p>
      <p class="how-i-work__copy">
        Regardless of audience or scope, every project receives the same attention to detail. Nothing ships until it feels right to use.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-i-work {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #08090a;
    color: #f4f3f0;
    padding-bottom: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 10rem);
  }

  .how-i-work__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    min-height: 180vh;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .how-i-work__photo {
    position: relative;
    overflow: visible;
    background: #0a0b0c;
  }

  .how-i-work__photo-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 180vh;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, rgba(216, 27, 106, 0.08), transparent 50%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0b0c 0%, #111 50%, #0a0b0c 100%);
  }

  .how-i-work__photo-label {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1.5rem;
    left: 1.5rem;
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.56rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .how-i-work__caption {
    position: absolute;
    top: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    left: 8%;
    right: -60%;
    max-width: none;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: #f4f3f0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0 clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .how-i-work__caption-accent {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .how-i-work__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: clamp(12rem, 20vw, 16rem) clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .how-i-work__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.2vw, 1.1rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .how-i-work__copy {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-reading);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.8vw, 1.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.88);
    max-width: 48ch;
  }

  .how-i-work__copy + .how-i-work__copy {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .how-i-work__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .how-i-work__photo {
      min-height: 70vh;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .how-i-work__caption {
      right: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 2.5rem);
    }

    .how-i-work__text {
      padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    }

    .how-i-work__copy {
      font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 4vw, 1.5rem);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
  }
</style>
